 [('I came ___ the field by accident. (across)','across','come across.',None),('She came ___ with a course. (up)','up','come up with.',None),('It all comes ___ to listening. (down)','down','come down to.',None),('Languages come in ___ . (handy)','handy','come in handy.',None)],
